<title>NETHERLANDS: Bal Nedam wins orders of over NLG 1 bln.</title>
<headline>Bal Nedam wins orders of over NLG 1 bln.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch construction and dredging firm Ballast Nedam NV said on Wednesday it had won orders worth over one billion guilders at home and abroad in the second quarter of 1997.  </p>
<p>The company said the orders included infrastructure works, large-scale dredging projects, office buildings and terminals.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
